## Request

Build the smallest complete server-rendered fleet search and filter slice on the existing hosted
dashboard. Match only allowlisted reported fields, keep current recent-activity ordering
explainable, and preserve the hosted dashboard's advisory presentation-only role.

## Contract Decisions

- Global query covers project name, stable artifact ID, bounded artifact title, controlled
  lifecycle/status, and reported client version only.
- Filters and search are encoded in stable GET parameters and work correctly with pagination.
- Active filter state, result count, clear/reset, and match context are visible and accessible.
- Search and filters never change local queue, planning order, project visibility preference, or
  any lifecycle state.
- Bounded query terms, database-backed predicates, and focused query-count checks prevent fleet
  growth from turning the landing page into an unbounded scan.

